# Same-map Galactic HQ panel pair: step travel, no bounce, reverse travel, idle save.
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_GALACTIC_HQ_3F 15 14 up
until idle
+0 press up
until position 6 14 1000
+0 release up
until idle
+0 assert facing player down
+0 reload
until idle
+0 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_GALACTIC_HQ_3F 6 14
+0 press down
until position 6 15
+0 release down
until idle
+0 press up
until position 15 13 1000
+0 release up
until idle
+0 assert facing player down
